ent-service-readme.md-15-78e29a83201a", "document_id": "repo-md-learning-agent-service-readme.md", "title": "HTTP DTO Ownership", "score": 0.30887421256948716, "route": "hybrid", "rank": 17, "summary": "The public API boundary keeps one canonical public payload model set for streaming: - `api/contracts.py` owns HTTP request DTOs and public event validation - the SSE envelope serializes through one validation map befo...", "chunk_type": "concept", "source_type": "document", "version": "repo-local", "matched_routes": ["dense"], "fused_score": 0.012987012987012988, "rrf_score": 0.012987012987012988, "source_chunk_id": "repo-learning-agent-service-readme.md-15-78e29a83201a", "citation_chunk_id": "repo-learning-agent-service-readme.md-15-78e29a83201a", "score_breakdown": {"rrf": 0.012987012987012988}, "metadata": {"source_path": "learning-agent-service/README.md", "heading": "HTTP DTO Ownership", "heading_level": 2, "section_index": 15, "line_start": 487, "line_end": 494, "source_kind": "repo_local_markdown"}}, {"chunk_id": "repo-learning-agent-service-readme.md-16-658a262f543c", "document_id": "repo-md-learning-agent-service-readme.md", "title": "RAG Behavior", "score": 0.3049142867673142, "route": "hybrid", "rank": 18, "summary": "Current RAG is a structured pipeline, not a single opaque call: ```text raw query -> query rewrite -> hybrid retrieve -> evidence governance -> citation build ```", "chunk_type": "concept", "source_type": "document", "version": "repo-local", "matched_routes": ["dense"], "fused_score": 0.01282051282051282, "rrf_score": 0.01282051282051282, "source_chunk_id": "repo-learning-agent-service-readme.md-16-658a262f543c", "citation_chunk_id": "repo-learning-agent-service-readme.md-16-658a262f543c", "score_breakdown": {"rrf": 0.01282051282051282}, "metadata": {"source_path": "learning-agent-service/README.md", "heading": "RAG Behavior", "heading_level": 2, "section_index": 16, "line_start": 496, "line_end": 506, "source_kind": "repo_local_markdown"}}, 